{
 "_meta": {
  "bed": "local ERPNext dev bed, v15.94.3 (frappe 15.96.0), Standard chart of accounts, IDR",
  "recorded": "2026-11-16",
  "ticket": "#1599",
  "about": "ECX6-T0: Employee create, mandatory fields",
  "names": "synthetic: company \"ECX Probe Co\" (abbr EPC), parties and employees named \"ECX Probe ...\" / \"Probe ...\", bed users replaced by role labels",
  "apiUsers": {
   "apiUserWithSystemManager": "token-auth API user holding the 901-bot role set (Accounts Manager/User, Purchase Manager/User, Stock Manager/User, Sales Manager/User, Projects Manager/User, System Manager) plus HR Manager/User and, from the Supplier probe on, Purchase Master Manager",
   "apiUserWithoutSystemManager": "same roles minus System Manager (and without Purchase Master Manager)"
  },
  "notes": [
   "POST /api/resource/Employee. Mandatory (MandatoryError, 417): first_name, gender, date_of_birth, date_of_joining. company is also required but is defaulted from the API user (the bed silently used ANOTHER company when it was omitted: always send company). status defaults to Active. No holiday list, department, user or contact is required.",
   "Gender is a link doctype; the bed has: Male, Female, Other, Transgender, Genderqueer, Non-Conforming, Prefer not to say. An unknown gender -> 417 LinkValidationError \"Could not find Gender: ...\".",
   "Date checks: date_of_birth in the future -> 417 ValidationError; joining before birth -> 417 InvalidDates. No minimum age check (an under-18 birth date is accepted). A future joining date is accepted.",
   "Naming: HR-EMP-NNNNN (naming series). Names are not unique; employee_number is not unique (a duplicate is accepted). An unknown company, department, holiday list or user_id -> 417 LinkValidationError. An unknown body field is dropped silently.",
   "Create works for a user without System Manager (HR Manager).",
   "There is no field that is unique and PMO-owned. A lookup-before-create has to anchor on employee_number (not unique) or a custom field: see the findings file."
  ],
  "v16": "identical"
 },
